{"seq":2,"slug":"infinite-scroll-pagination","title":"无限滚动与分页","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/infinite-scroll-pagination","wordCount":1150,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"无限滚动与分页\">无限滚动与分页</h1><p>列表数据的加载策略直接影响用户体验的流畅度和应用的内存健康度。传统分页将用户锁定在离散的页面之间跳转，无限滚动则提供了连续的浏览体验——但也引入了滚动位置恢复、内存增长和双向加载等工程挑战。本文系统性地分析两种模式的实现细节与生产级考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>游标分页优于偏移分页</strong>：偏移分页在数据变动时会重复/遗漏条目，游标分页通过锚定上一条记录的唯一标识保证无遗漏</li>\n<li><strong>maxPages 内存控制</strong>：TanStack Query v5 的 <code>maxPages</code> 限制内存中保留的最大页数，超出部分自动丢弃——配合双向加载实现虚拟数据窗口</li>\n<li><strong>Intersection Observer 触底检测</strong>：比 scroll 事件监听更高效，<code>rootMargin</code> 参数可提前触发加载消除&quot;滚到底等待&quot;的感知</li>\n<li><strong>placeholderData 防闪烁</strong>：传统分页切换时用 <code>keepPreviousData</code> 保持前一页数据直到新页就绪，避免白屏闪烁</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分页模式的选择\">分页模式的选择</h2><p>三种常见的分页策略各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>URL 示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏移分页</td>\n<td><code>?page=3&amp;limit=20</code></td>\n<td>支持跳页、实现简单</td>\n<td>数据变动导致重复/遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游标分页</td>\n<td><code>?cursor=abc&amp;limit=20</code></td>\n<td>无重复遗漏、性能稳定</td>\n<td>不支持跳页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键集分页</td>\n<td><code>?after_id=123&amp;limit=20</code></td>\n<td>数据库索引友好</td>\n<td>仅支持单向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>游标分页在数据频繁变动的场景（如社交 feed）中几乎是唯一正确的选择——当用户浏览第 3 页时，如果有新内容插入到第 1 页，偏移分页会导致第 3 页显示与第 2 页最后一条重复的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tanstack-query-的-useinfinitequery\">TanStack Query 的 useInfiniteQuery</h2><p>TanStack Query v5 中无限查询需要显式声明 <code>initialPageParam</code>，返回 <code>null</code> 表示没有更多页：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PostsResponse {&#10;  items: Post[];&#10;  nextCursor: string | null;&#10;  hasMore: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const {&#10;  data,&#10;  fetchNextPage,&#10;  fetchPreviousPage,&#10;  hasNextPage,&#10;  hasPreviousPage,&#10;  isFetchingNextPage,&#10;  isFetchingPreviousPage,&#10;} = useInfiniteQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;posts&#39;, filters],&#10;  queryFn: ({ pageParam, signal }): Promise&lt;PostsResponse&gt; =&gt; api.getPosts({ cursor: pageParam, ...filters, signal }),&#10;  initialPageParam: null as string | null,&#10;  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) =&gt; lastPage.nextCursor,&#10;  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) =&gt; firstPage.previousCursor ?? null,&#10;  maxPages: 5, // 限制内存中保留的最大页数&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 扁平化所有页的数据&#10;const allPosts = data?.pages.flatMap((page) =&gt; page.items) ?? [];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostsResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  nextCursor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hasMore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  fetchNextPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  fetchPreviousPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  hasNextPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  hasPreviousPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  isFetchingNextPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  isFetchingPreviousPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useInfiniteQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, filters],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pageParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PostsResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ cursor: pageParam, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filters, signal }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialPageParam: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getNextPageParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lastPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastPage.nextCursor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getPreviousPageParam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">firstPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> firstPage.previousCursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxPages: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 限制内存中保留的最大页数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扁平化所有页的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allPosts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data?.pages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.items) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[用户滚动到底部] --&gt; B{hasNextPage?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[fetchNextPage]&#10;    C --&gt; D[pageParam = getNextPageParam]&#10;    D --&gt; E[queryFn 请求新页]&#10;    E --&gt; F[追加到 pages 数组]&#10;    F --&gt; G[UI 渲染新内容]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| H[&quot;显示#quot;没有更多了#quot;&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[用户滚动到底部] --&gt; B{hasNextPage?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[fetchNextPage]\n    C --&gt; D[pageParam = getNextPageParam]\n    D --&gt; E[queryFn 请求新页]\n    E --&gt; F[追加到 pages 数组]\n    F --&gt; G[UI 渲染新内容]\n    B --&gt;|否| H[\"显示#quot;没有更多了#quot;\"]</pre><h2 id=\"maxpages-与内存管理\">maxPages 与内存管理</h2><p>v5 引入的 <code>maxPages</code> 选项解决了无限滚动的内存增长问题。当用户已加载 50 页数据时，所有页面都驻留在内存中——这对长列表来说是不可接受的内存消耗。</p>\n<p><code>maxPages</code> 的工作机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>内存行为</th>\n<th>用户体验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不设置</td>\n<td>所有已加载页永驻内存</td>\n<td>长时间浏览可能导致 OOM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maxPages: 5</code></td>\n<td>最多保留 5 页</td>\n<td>向上滚动超出范围需重新加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maxPages: 10</code></td>\n<td>最多保留 10 页</td>\n<td>平衡内存与体验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当页数超过 <code>maxPages</code> 时，方向相反的最早页被丢弃。配合 <code>getPreviousPageParam</code>，用户向上滚动时可以重新获取被丢弃的页面——实现了双向虚拟滚动的数据层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滚动位置恢复\">滚动位置恢复</h2><p>用户从详情页返回列表时，期望看到之前的滚动位置。这需要缓存和 DOM 协作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 方案一：利用浏览器原生 scroll restoration&#10;// 前提：列表数据仍在缓存中（gcTime 足够长）&#10;&#10;// 方案二：手动保存滚动位置&#10;const scrollPositionRef = useRef(0);&#10;&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const container = scrollRef.current;&#10;  if (!container) return;&#10;&#10;  const handleScroll = () =&gt; {&#10;    scrollPositionRef.current = container.scrollTop;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  container.addEventListener(&#39;scroll&#39;, handleScroll, { passive: true });&#10;  return () =&gt; container.removeEventListener(&#39;scroll&#39;, handleScroll);&#10;}, []);&#10;&#10;// 从详情页返回时恢复位置&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  if (data &amp;&amp; scrollRef.current) {&#10;    scrollRef.current.scrollTop = scrollPositionRef.current;&#10;  }&#10;}, [data]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案一：利用浏览器原生 scroll restoration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 前提：列表数据仍在缓存中（gcTime 足够长）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案二：手动保存滚动位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scrollPositionRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scrollRef.current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">container) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleScroll</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scrollPositionRef.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> container.scrollTop;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  container.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scroll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handleScroll, { passive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> container.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">removeEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scroll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handleScroll);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, []);</span></span>\n<span cla