n style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {data?.items.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Row</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预取下一页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (data?.hasMore) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prefetchQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { page: page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ page: page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, [data, page])</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"加载状态与骨架屏\">加载状态与骨架屏</h2><p>无限滚动中的加载状态需要区分&quot;首次加载&quot;和&quot;加载更多&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>UI 建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>isPending</code>（首次）</td>\n<td>列表完全空白</td>\n<td>全屏骨架屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isFetchingNextPage</code></td>\n<td>已有数据，正在加载更多</td>\n<td>底部加载指示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isFetchingPreviousPage</code></td>\n<td>向上加载历史数据</td>\n<td>顶部加载指示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isRefetching</code></td>\n<td>后台刷新</td>\n<td>不可见或微小指示器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Empty: 首次加载&#10;    Empty --&gt; HasData: 首页加载完成&#10;    HasData --&gt; LoadingMore: 触发 fetchNextPage&#10;    LoadingMore --&gt; HasData: 新页加载完成&#10;    HasData --&gt; Refreshing: 后台重验证&#10;    Refreshing --&gt; HasData: 刷新完成&#10;    HasData --&gt; NoMore: nextCursor === null\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Empty: 首次加载\n    Empty --&gt; HasData: 首页加载完成\n    HasData --&gt; LoadingMore: 触发 fetchNextPage\n    LoadingMore --&gt; HasData: 新页加载完成\n    HasData --&gt; Refreshing: 后台重验证\n    Refreshing --&gt; HasData: 刷新完成\n    HasData --&gt; NoMore: nextCursor === null</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>无限滚动与分页的核心挑战在于平衡内存消耗、加载体验和数据一致性。游标分页解决数据正确性，maxPages 控制内存增长，Intersection Observer 实现无缝触发，虚拟化列表优化 DOM 性能。无限滚动是数据量维度的扩展，而<a href=\"realtime-subscriptions\">实时订阅</a>则是时间维度的扩展——从&quot;用户主动拉取&quot;转为&quot;服务端主动推送&quot;，这是完全不同的数据流模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无限滚动与分页","id":"无限滚动与分页"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分页模式的选择","id":"分页模式的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"TanStack Query 的 useInfiniteQuery","id":"tanstack-query-的-useinfinitequery"},{"level":2,"text":"maxPages 与内存管理","id":"maxpages-与内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动位置恢复","id":"滚动位置恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"Intersection Observer 触发加载","id":"intersection-observer-触发加载"},{"level":2,"text":"SWR 的 useSWRInfinite","id":"swr-的-useswrinfinite"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟化列表集成","id":"虚拟化列表集成"},{"level":2,"text":"分页切换的平滑体验","id":"分页切换的平滑体验"},{"level":2,"text":"加载状态与骨架屏","id":"加载状态与骨架屏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"乐观更新与回滚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/optimistic-updates"},"next":{"title":"实时订阅与 WebSocket 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/realtime-subscriptions"}}